  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p><b style=\"font-weight:700;\">• About our brand and products:</b><br>Pet Juice is a family-started and operated pet wellness brand on a mission to transform how we nourish our animals — from the inside out. Our flagship product is a naturally fermented liquid supplement for dogs, packed with living microbes, enzymes, pre/probiotics, and minerals. Unlike powders or chews, our formula is never heated, which means every nutrient stays active and bioavailable. It's clean, effective, and unlike anything else on the market.<br><br><b style=\"font-weight:700;\">• What makes us different:</b><br>Most pet supplements are dead on arrival — processed, heated, and full of fillers. Pet Juice is <b style=\"font-weight:700;\">living nutrition</b> in liquid form. Our proprietary fermentation process preserves active microbes and enzymes that support gut health, digestion, hydration, immune function, and daily vitality. We're not another probiotic — we're a new category of pet wellness.<br><br><b style=\"font-weight:700;\">• How affiliates can earn:</b><br>Affiliates earn a commission on every sale they drive. You'll receive a unique referral link to share with your audience, and you'll get credit for every order that comes through it. We offer competitive commissions, tracked via Uppromote, with reliable and timely payouts.<br><br><b style=\"font-weight:700;\">• How to promote us:</b><br>The best content shows real pets and real routines. We love before/after transformation stories, educational posts about gut health and fermented nutrition, and \"what I give my dog every morning\" style content. Our product adds easily to food or water, making it a natural fit for daily routine content on TikTok, Instagram Reels, YouTube, or blogs.<br><br><b style=\"font-weight:700;\">• Other information:</b><br>Pet Juice is a family-started and operated business — built by people who truly care about the animals our customers love. We welcome affiliates who are passionate about pet wellness and create authentic content. Reach out anytime — we're easy to work with and love collaborating with our partners on content ideas and launches.</p></div>",
